shows a generalization gap of up to 20%. This suggests that NLI models need to be adapted to their target domain for optimal performance.", "How Retrieved Context Shapes Internal Representations in RAG
1 Introduction
Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) has become a widely adopted approach for enhancing large language models (LLMs) with external knowledge (
