II Background and Related Work
II-C Agentic RAG
Surveys have charted the shift from static pipelines to agentic systems capable of dynamic tool use, iterative retrieval, and self-correction [
[13](#bib.bib1)
,
[45](#bib.bib2)
,
[34](#bib.bib53)
