[1](#S4.F1)
). The following subsections present the four main components: (1) extracting temporal information from source documents, (2) processing time-sensitive queries, (3) performing temporally-aware retrieval, and (4) structuring context for generation. This holistic approach aims to enhance the accuracy of retrieved evidence and the temporal reasoning capabilities of the final generation model.
